	Administration Course Creators section body: the companies that own courses and offer them.

	The other half of Companies. A creator is described by the courses it owns, so this screen shows
	that figure and not the staff or enrolment counts, which say nothing about a company in this
	role. A company that both owns courses and trains its own staff appears here and on Course
	Consumers, because it is both.

	Manage hands one company to the Company workspace as the administered context; Edit changes the
	company record itself. The two are different actions and are deliberately separate buttons.

	WARNING: a template comment is not a safe place to document syntax. A comment delimiter
	written inside a comment body ends the comment early and leaks the remainder onto the page.
